 "about": "Import rules: how folder names become scheme names, which filename prefixes are themes bundled in one folder, which folder levels to skip in names, and default license notes. Keys are matched case-insensitively against a folder name, or against a path relative to the import root. merge_folders: format or category folders whose files belong to the scheme above them. event_folders: folders whose files are all one event and belong to the scheme above. collect_folders: a folder that gathers every subfolder below it into one scheme, all files one event. windows_app_events: Windows registry AppEvents names (in .Theme and .reg files) to generic events. collect_folders_containing: like collect_folders, for any folder whose name contains the word (Mac alert sets become alert-sound schemes). preferred_first: which file comes first in a collected folder.",
